WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:05.240
I'm Jenna Fisher.
我是珍娜·费舍尔。

2
00:00:05.420 --> 00:00:06.620
And I'm Angela Kinsey.
我是安吉拉·金赛。

3
00:00:06.840 --> 00:00:08.200
We were on The Office together.
我们曾一起出演《办公室》。

4
00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:09.460
And we're best friends.
我们还是最好的朋友。

5
00:00:09.720 --> 00:00:13.600
And now we're doing the ultimate Office Lovers podcast just for you.
现在，我们专门为你们制作了这个终极《办公室》粉丝播客。

6
00:00:13.820 --> 00:00:18.120
Each week, we will dive deeper into the world of The Office with exclusive interviews,
每周，我们都会通过独家访谈深入探索《办公室》的世界，

7
00:00:18.400 --> 00:00:21.280
behind-the-scenes details, and lots of BFF stories.
分享幕后细节，还有许多我们闺蜜间的故事。

8
00:00:21.340 --> 00:00:23.320
We're The Office Lady 6.0.
我们是《办公室》女士 6.0。

9
00:00:27.910 --> 00:00:29.630
Hi, happy Wednesday.
嗨，周三快乐。

10
00:00:30.630 --> 00:00:32.830
Hi, Jenna is giddy.
嗨，珍娜很兴奋。

11
00:00:33.050 --> 00:00:34.370
She is giddy.
她确实很兴奋。

12
00:00:34.370 --> 00:00:40.830
She's like, you're actually blushing because you're so – I feel like you have a body buzz right now.
她看起来……你真的脸红了，因为你太——我觉得你现在整个人都处于一种亢奋状态。

13
00:00:41.150 --> 00:00:50.590
Well, everyone, this Friday is Valentine's Day, and Angela, you have given me the greatest Galentine's Day gift of our friendship.
好吧，各位，这个周五就是情人节了，安吉拉，你给了我我们友谊中最棒的闺蜜节礼物。

14
00:00:51.050 --> 00:00:52.650
I guess I have.
我想是的。

15
00:00:52.810 --> 00:00:56.550
I was thinking of like all the gifts we've exchanged over the years.
我回想了一下这些年来我们交换过的所有礼物。

16
00:00:56.550 --> 00:00:58.030
This might be your favorite.
这可能是你最喜欢的一个。

17
00:00:58.430 --> 00:00:59.330
It might be.
也许吧。

18
00:00:59.590 --> 00:01:00.850
Should we tell them what it is?
我们要告诉大家是什么吗？

19
00:01:00.930 --> 00:01:01.250
Please.
请吧。

20
00:01:01.850 --> 00:01:02.110
Okay.
好的。

21
00:01:02.530 --> 00:01:08.990
Well, you guys, we went into the Dear Office Ladies mailbag, and a lot of you wrote in saying
各位，我们查看了“亲爱的办公室女士”的邮箱，你们很多人写信说

22
00:01:08.990 --> 00:01:11.110
that I should watch The Edge.
我应该看看《势不两立》这部电影。

23
00:01:11.390 --> 00:01:12.070
Thank you.
谢谢你们。

24
00:01:12.230 --> 00:01:13.410
Thank you for writing that.
谢谢你们写信建议。

25
00:01:13.770 --> 00:01:18.110
Emma Grace from Texas, will you please add The Edge to your movie list to break down on
来自德克萨斯州的艾玛·格蕾丝，你能把《势不两立》加到你们的电影清单里，

26
00:01:18.110 --> 00:01:18.630
the podcast?
在播客里解析一下吗？

27
00:01:19.130 --> 00:01:20.650
I watched it because of Jenna.
因为珍娜，我看了这部电影。

28
00:01:20.930 --> 00:01:22.210
It's one of my all-time favorites.
这是我最喜欢的电影之一。

29
00:01:22.370 --> 00:01:23.130
She's right.
她说得对。

30
00:01:23.130 --> 00:01:24.850
It is so inspirational.
它太励志了。

31
00:01:25.130 --> 00:01:25.790
It is, Emma.
确实如此，艾玛。

32
00:01:25.870 --> 00:01:26.370
It is.
确实。

33
00:01:26.730 --> 00:01:29.710
We got several letters like this, lady.
我们收到了好几封这样的信，女士。

34
00:01:29.950 --> 00:01:30.950
And you know what?
你知道吗？

35
00:01:31.250 --> 00:01:34.470
You did watch the Star Wars Christmas special for me.
你确实为了我看了《星球大战》圣诞特辑。

36
00:01:34.690 --> 00:01:35.430
I did.
我看了。

37
00:01:35.550 --> 00:01:36.030
You did.
你看了。

38
00:01:36.210 --> 00:01:39.310
You technically watched a Star Wars movie-ish.
你严格来说看了一部类似《星球大战》的电影。

39
00:01:39.690 --> 00:01:48.490
Well, so for this Valentine's, my gift to you is I said, let's break down the edge, lady.
所以这个情人节，我给你的礼物就是，我说，我们来解析《势不两立》吧，女士。

40
00:01:48.650 --> 00:01:49.530
Let's do it.
我们开始吧。

41
00:01:49.970 --> 00:01:52.610
This was the most amazing work week for me, Angela.
安吉拉，这对我来说是工作最棒的一周。

42
00:01:53.090 --> 00:01:56.690
I got to watch my favorite movie for work.
我竟然能为了工作看我最喜欢的电影。

43
00:01:57.270 --> 00:01:58.070
I know.
我知道。

44
00:01:58.210 --> 00:01:59.310
You kept texting me.
你一直在给我发短信。

45
00:01:59.310 --> 00:02:00.490
This is my work day.
这就是我的工作日。

46
00:02:00.490 --> 00:02:03.710
And it would just be a screenshot of like a bear in the woods.
然后发来的只是一张森林里熊的截图之类的东西。

47
00:02:04.170 --> 00:02:05.510
Well, I got so excited.
好吧，我太兴奋了。

48
00:02:05.510 --> 00:02:07.610
I said we should even bring back Fast Facts.
我说我们甚至应该带回“快速事实”环节。

49
00:02:07.750 --> 00:02:09.670
So I say, let's get to it.
所以我说，我们开始吧。

50
00:02:09.790 --> 00:02:10.390
Let's do it.
我们开始吧。

51
00:02:10.690 --> 00:02:11.190
All right.
好的。

52
00:02:11.590 --> 00:02:12.490
The Edge.
《势不两立》。

53
00:02:12.670 --> 00:02:17.050
Written by David Mamet, Pulitzer Prize and Tony winning playwright.
编剧是大卫·马梅，普利策奖和托尼奖得主。

54
00:02:17.250 --> 00:02:18.890
He's also a director and screenwriter.
他同时也是一位导演和编剧。

55
00:02:19.150 --> 00:02:23.070
He is a master of dialogue and the dialogue in this movie is fantastic.
他是对白大师，这部电影里的对白非常精彩。

56
00:02:23.850 --> 00:02:28.310
This film is directed by Lee Tamahori from New Zealand.
这部电影由来自新西兰的李·塔玛霍瑞执导。

57
00:02:28.310 --> 00:02:34.570
And his directorial debut was Once Were Warriors, which was a huge critical success.
他的导演处女作是《战士奇兵》，在影评界获得了巨大成功。

58
00:02:34.570 --> 00:02:40.950
It won many, many awards and was the highest grossing film in New Zealand of all time.
它赢得了许多奖项，并成为新西兰影史上票房最高的电影。

59
00:02:41.150 --> 00:02:41.410
Wow.
哇。

60
00:02:41.870 --> 00:02:42.390
That's right.
没错。

61
00:02:42.670 --> 00:02:46.650
And he also directed huge hits like Mulholland Falls, Boys on the Side.
他还执导过《穆赫兰道》和《伴我情深》等大热影片。

62
00:02:47.550 --> 00:02:49.710
Let's jump into fast fact number one.
让我们进入第一个速览事实。

63
00:02:50.210 --> 00:02:53.810
The Edge is one hour and 57 wonderful minutes.
《势不两立》时长一小时五十七分钟，非常精彩。

64
00:02:53.930 --> 00:02:57.050
It was released September 26, 1997.
它于1997年9月26日上映。

65
00:02:57.050 --> 00:03:05.010
It had a budget of $30 million, and it made $43.3 million at the worldwide box office.
它的预算为3000万美元，全球票房收入为4330万美元。

66
00:03:05.970 --> 00:03:07.390
Here is your caSt.
这是演员阵容。

67
00:03:08.050 --> 00:03:11.370
Anthony Hopkins plays billionaire Charles Morse.
安东尼·霍普金斯饰演亿万富翁查尔斯·莫尔斯。

68
00:03:12.050 --> 00:03:14.790
Alec Baldwin is handsome photographer Bob Green.
亚历克·鲍德温饰演英俊的摄影师鲍勃·格林。

69
00:03:15.370 --> 00:03:19.090
Harold Perrineau is Bob's photography assistant, Stephen.
哈罗德·佩里诺饰演鲍勃的摄影助理斯蒂芬。

70
00:03:19.090 --> 00:03:20.590
You might know him from LoSt.
你可能在《迷失》里见过他。

71
00:03:20.830 --> 00:03:22.930
He played Michael Dawson in LoSt.
他在《迷失》中饰演迈克尔·道森。

72
00:03:22.930 --> 00:03:23.910
He's so good in it.
他在那部剧里演得太好了。

73
00:03:23.990 --> 00:03:24.450
So good.
真的很好。

74
00:03:24.470 --> 00:03:26.670
He's also in two Matrix movies, you guys.
伙计们，他还出演了两部《黑客帝国》电影。

75
00:03:27.050 --> 00:03:28.770
Oh, so you liked this.
哦，所以你喜欢这个。

76
00:03:28.910 --> 00:03:29.230
Uh-huh.
嗯哼。

77
00:03:29.390 --> 00:03:30.290
Okay, this is great.
好的，这太棒了。

78
00:03:30.410 --> 00:03:30.930
This is good.
这很好。

79
00:03:31.090 --> 00:03:39.290
And then finally, rounding out the cast is Elle McPherson as billionaire Charles Morse's wife, supermodel Mickey Morse.
最后，演员阵容还包括饰演亿万富翁查尔斯·莫尔斯妻子、超模米基·莫尔斯的艾拉·麦克弗森。

80
00:03:39.610 --> 00:03:43.010
And you know Elle McPherson is a real-life supermodel.
你知道艾拉·麦克弗森在现实生活中也是一位超模。

81
00:03:43.730 --> 00:03:44.990
Here's a fact for you.
这里有个事实告诉你。

82
00:03:45.290 --> 00:03:48.390
The original title of this movie was Bookworm.
这部电影最初的片名是《书虫》。

83
00:03:48.670 --> 00:03:54.470
But about three months before the movie was set to come out, the studio decided that it needed a more commercial title.
但在电影上映前大约三个月，制片厂决定需要一个更具商业气息的片名。

84
00:03:54.470 --> 00:03:58.050
Something that really spoke to the suspense of the film.
一个能真正体现电影悬疑感的片名。

85
00:03:58.250 --> 00:03:59.770
I think I agree with them.
我想我同意他们的看法。

86
00:04:00.030 --> 00:04:00.790
I agree.
我同意。

87
00:04:01.870 --> 00:04:08.250
The role of Bob Green, played by Alec Baldwin, was originally offered to Harrison Ford and Dustin Hoffman.
由亚历克·鲍德温饰演的鲍勃·格林一角，最初曾邀请哈里森·福特和达斯汀·霍夫曼出演。

88
00:04:08.870 --> 00:04:09.470
What?
什么？

89
00:04:09.890 --> 00:04:10.570
Could you imagine?
你能想象吗？

90
00:04:10.950 --> 00:04:11.370
No.
不能。

91
00:04:11.850 --> 00:04:13.670
Dustin Hoffman as Bob?
达斯汀·霍夫曼演鲍勃？

92
00:04:13.810 --> 00:04:14.430
As Bob.
演鲍勃。

93
00:04:15.090 --> 00:04:16.870
Well, no, I can't.
嗯，不，我无法想象。

94
00:04:17.030 --> 00:04:23.590
I also read that Robert De Niro showed some interest in the role of billionaire Charles Morse, but that it went to Anthony Hopkins.
我还读到罗伯特·德尼罗对亿万富翁查尔斯·莫尔斯这个角色表现出了一些兴趣，但最终还是由安东尼·霍普金斯出演了。

95
00:04:23.590 --> 00:04:26.450
I literally can't imagine anyone else in these roles.
我真的无法想象其他人来演这些角色。

96
00:04:27.030 --> 00:04:27.270
Yeah.
是啊。

97
00:04:27.610 --> 00:04:28.970
Yeah, it's hard to picture it.
是啊，很难想象会是那样。

98
00:04:29.670 --> 00:04:30.110
All right.
好的。

99
00:04:30.290 --> 00:04:31.390
Fast fact number two.
第二个速览事实。

100
00:04:31.630 --> 00:04:33.510
This film was shot in Alberta, Canada.
这部电影是在加拿大阿尔伯塔省拍摄的。

101
00:04:33.890 --> 00:04:38.950
It was shot between August and November 1996 in Banff National Park,
这部电影于1996年8月至11月期间在班夫国家公园拍摄，

102
00:04:39.370 --> 00:04:43.970
Canmore, Edmonton, Thunderstone Quarries, and Fortress Mountain Resort.
以及坎莫尔、埃德蒙顿、雷石采石场和堡垒山度假村。

103
00:04:44.230 --> 00:04:49.150
And here is an audio clip of director Lee Tamahori talking about the location.
下面是一段导演李·塔玛霍瑞谈论拍摄地点的音频片段。

104
00:04:49.630 --> 00:04:52.010
We really needed to take this film somewhere
我们确实需要把这部电影带到一个

105
00:04:52.930 --> 00:04:54.670
that people haven't really been before,
人们从未真正去过的地方，

106
00:04:54.770 --> 00:04:56.270
so it needed to look very, very rugged.
所以它必须看起来非常、非常崎岖原始。

107
00:04:56.470 --> 00:04:57.990
You can't really fake that.
这种感觉是无法伪造的。

108
00:04:58.090 --> 00:05:01.470
You've got to take the actors and everybody into this environment.
你必须把演员和所有工作人员都带到这种环境中去。

109
00:05:01.570 --> 00:05:03.650
Give me your best fair confrontation.
给我展示你最公平的对决。

110
00:05:03.890 --> 00:05:06.890
They lost right in the heart of the wilderness,
他们迷失在荒野的中心地带，

111
00:05:07.190 --> 00:05:08.470
and you've got to know how to survive.
你必须知道如何生存下去。

112
00:05:09.950 --> 00:05:12.130
What I like about all of David Mamet's work
大卫·马梅特所有作品中我最喜欢的一点

113
00:05:12.130 --> 00:05:13.790
is that it's extremely primal.
就是它们极其原始。

114
00:05:13.910 --> 00:05:16.210
It's one guy pitted against another guy,
是一个人与另一个人对抗，

115
00:05:16.510 --> 00:05:18.130
two guys pitted against the wilderness.
两个人与荒野对抗。

116
00:05:18.130 --> 00:05:25.210
When you take actors, the likes of Tony, who's never been exposed to this type of harrowing location, it braces them up more.
当你带着像托尼这样的演员，他从未接触过这种令人痛苦的拍摄环境时，这会让他们更加振作。

117
00:05:25.750 --> 00:05:28.050
So, lady, they were really out there.
所以，女士，他们是真的身处野外。

118
00:05:28.430 --> 00:05:31.250
The actors, the crew, in the wilderness.
演员们，剧组人员，都在荒野之中。

119
00:05:31.870 --> 00:05:34.030
I want to paint a little picture for you.
我想为你描绘一下当时的场景。

120
00:05:34.910 --> 00:05:42.230
The temperatures in Banff National Park in August are a high of 62 and a low of 33.
班夫国家公园8月份的气温最高为62华氏度，最低为33华氏度。

121
00:05:42.230 --> 00:05:49.050
But when we get to November, the high is 24 degrees and the low is 3.
但到了11月，最高气温只有24华氏度，最低气温为3华氏度。

122
00:05:49.450 --> 00:05:51.250
Yeah, that's not a lot.
是啊，那可真够冷的。

123
00:05:51.770 --> 00:05:55.930
Josh went on a hiking trip with his college buddies there and absolutely loved it.
乔什曾和他的大学伙伴去那里徒步旅行，并且非常喜欢那里。

124
00:05:56.050 --> 00:05:57.510
But it is rugged terrain.
但那里的地形确实崎岖不平。

125
00:05:57.810 --> 00:05:58.130
Yes.
没错。

126
00:05:58.370 --> 00:06:01.250
These fellas spend a lot of time in water.
这些家伙花了很多时间泡在水里。

127
00:06:01.430 --> 00:06:02.970
I check the seawater temperatures.
我查了一下海水温度。

128
00:06:02.970 --> 00:06:06.810
In August, they're around 54 to 61 degrees.
在8月份，水温大约在54到61华氏度之间。

129
00:06:07.430 --> 00:06:11.290
For reference, I keep my cold dip tank around 60 degrees.
作为参考，我平时用的冷水浸泡缸温度保持在60华氏度左右。

130
00:06:11.770 --> 00:06:15.250
I sit in it for one minute, and I go pretty numb in about 30 seconds.
我坐在里面一分钟，大约30秒就开始麻木了。

131
00:06:15.790 --> 00:06:19.390
In November, the water gets as low as like 50 degrees.
到了11月，水温会降到50华氏度左右。

132
00:06:19.870 --> 00:06:21.410
And they really got in it.
而且他们真的下水了。

133
00:06:21.610 --> 00:06:21.790
Yeah.
是啊。

134
00:06:21.970 --> 00:06:24.510
Like that wasn't like a soundstage or something.
那可不是什么摄影棚之类的场景。

135
00:06:24.710 --> 00:06:25.850
No, they look cold.
没错，他们看起来确实很冷。

136
00:06:26.030 --> 00:06:27.490
And they don't warm the water.
而且他们并没有给水加热。

137
00:06:27.570 --> 00:06:27.730
Right.
对。

138
00:06:27.790 --> 00:06:29.290
Obviously, it's seawater.
显然，那是海水。

139
00:06:29.490 --> 00:06:29.970
It's water.
那是水。

140
00:06:30.150 --> 00:06:30.910
It's natural water.
那是天然的水。

141
00:06:30.910 --> 00:06:33.230
You can't warm a park, lake.
你没法给公园里的湖泊加热。

142
00:06:33.470 --> 00:06:33.850
Correct.
没错。

143
00:06:34.230 --> 00:06:34.490
Yeah.
是啊。

144
00:06:34.970 --> 00:06:35.790
They're in it.
他们就在水里。

145
00:06:35.930 --> 00:06:36.570
They're in it.
他们就在水里。

146
00:06:36.870 --> 00:06:37.470
All right.
好吧。

147
00:06:37.910 --> 00:06:39.610
Well, I've told you the characters.
好了，我已经告诉过你们角色了。

148
00:06:39.670 --> 00:06:41.030
I've told you the location.
我也告诉过你们拍摄地点了。

149
00:06:41.290 --> 00:06:41.650
Angela.
安吉拉。

150
00:06:41.890 --> 00:06:43.670
Fast Fact 3, over to you.
快讯3，交给你了。

151
00:06:43.870 --> 00:06:47.410
Yeah, I took Fast Fact 3, and I'm going to give you two movie
没错，我选了“快讯3”，我要给你们带来两篇影评

152
00:06:47.410 --> 00:06:50.210
reviews and one of the original movie trailers.
和一部原版电影预告片。

153
00:06:50.570 --> 00:06:53.570
So people either really love this movie or they're
人们要么非常喜欢这部电影，要么就觉得

154
00:06:53.570 --> 00:06:55.390
like, eh, meh about it.
也就那样吧，一般般。

155
