查尔斯说，因为羞愧。

1438
01:03:12.210 --> 01:03:13.470
Yes, that's right.
是的，没错。

1439
01:03:13.470 --> 01:03:13.752
Right.
对。

1440
01:03:13.752 --> 01:03:19.250
So we're not going to blame ourselves for cutting our leg and making it harder for all of us to get out of the woods.
所以我们不会因为割伤了腿，让大家走出森林变得更困难而责怪自己。

1441
01:03:19.250 --> 01:03:20.590
We're just going to move on.
我们要继续前进。

1442
01:03:20.750 --> 01:03:21.270
That's right.
没错。

1443
01:03:21.390 --> 01:03:21.610
Okay.
好的。

1444
01:03:21.690 --> 01:03:22.650
We're all fine.
我们都没事。

1445
01:03:22.790 --> 01:03:24.830
This is just no biggie.
这没什么大不了的。

1446
01:03:25.010 --> 01:03:27.290
